# API conventions

- Auth via existing `lib.auth` helpers; respect AAL/MFA and rate limits.
- Public abuse surfaces use `lib.rate_limit` + optional `lib.captcha`.
- Prefer service role only where already patterned (leads, admin, webhooks).
- Add/extend tests under `tests/` for new auth, money, or tenancy logic.
- Do not log secrets. Keep `.env.example` in sync when adding env vars.
